{"seq":3,"slug":"audio-signal-processing","title":"音频信号处理","stage":"DONE","category":"music-audio","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"音频信号处理-简介\">音频信号处理 简介</h1><p>音频信号处理是连接声学物理世界与数字音乐制作的桥梁。当麦克风将空气振动转换为电信号、再由 ADC 转换为数字采样值的瞬间，声音便从模拟的连续世界跨入了离散的数学世界。在这个数学世界中，傅里叶变换揭示频率的秘密，滤波器塑造音色的形态，空间算法模拟声场的深度。</p>\n<p>本手册面向希望理解音频处理底层原理的学习者——无论你是音频工程师、音乐制作人还是音频算法开发者，掌握信号处理的基本理论都能让你从&quot;调参数&quot;的层面上升到&quot;理解参数为何如此设计&quot;的层面。</p>\n<p>全书分为四个章节：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章「数字音频基础」</strong> 从 ADC/DAC 转换过程讲起，系统介绍采样定理、量化精度、编码格式等核心概念。你将理解为什么 CD 音质是 44.1kHz/16bit，为什么高采样率并不总是意味着更好的音质。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章「频谱分析」</strong> 进入频域世界。FFT 是音频分析的核心工具——它将时域波形分解为频率成分。本章讲解 DFT/FFT 的数学原理、窗函数的选择策略以及时频分析（STFT、小波变换）在音乐信号中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章「音频效果」</strong> 聚焦实用的音频效果算法——EQ（均衡器）、动态处理（压缩/限幅）与空间效果（混响/延迟）。你将学习这些效果器的底层算法逻辑，而非仅仅是面板上旋钮的操作方法。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章「空间音频」</strong> 探索声音在三维空间中的表现与渲染。从立体声的基本原理到沉浸式空间音频（Dolby Atmos、Apple Spatial Audio）的技术实现，这是音频技术领域当前最活跃的发展前沿。</p>\n<p>建议在学习过程中配合 Python（librosa/scipy）或 MATLAB 进行实际信号处理实验，将数学公式与听觉感受建立直观关联。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-audio-basics","title":"数字音频基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sampling-theorem","title":"采样定理与模数转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/sampling-theorem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantization","title":"量化精度与动态范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/quantization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"codec-formats","title":"音频编解码与传输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/digital-audio-basics/codec-formats"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"spectral-analysis","title":"频谱分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fft-fundamentals","title":"FFT 频谱分析原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stft-spectrogram","title":"时频分析与短时傅里叶变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/stft-spectrogram"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-extraction","title":"频谱特征提取与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/feature-extraction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"audio-effects","title":"音频效果","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eq-filters","title":"EQ 均衡器与滤波器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/eq-filters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamics-processing","title":"动态处理与压缩器原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/dynamics-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reverb-spatial","title":"混响与空间效果算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/reverb-spatial"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"spatial-audio","title":"空间音频","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stereo-principles","title":"立体声原理与声像定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/stereo-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"surround-sound","title":"环绕声系统与多声道格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/surround-sound"},{"seq":3,"slug":"immersive-audio","title":"沉浸式音频与空间渲染技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/immersive-audio"}]}]}